This repository contains a dataset and software libraries.

The dataset at the repository root (CSV files, metadata.json, README.md
and CITATION.cff) is licensed under Creative Commons Attribution 4.0
International (CC BY 4.0). See LICENSE-DATA.

The library code under packages/ is licensed under the MIT License.
See LICENSE-MIT. The question lists and nationality-acquisition
statistics bundled inside those packages are also licensed under
CC BY 4.0; see packages/*/LICENSE-DATA.

Source texts and official figures remain French public sector
information (Licence Ouverte / etalab-2.0 where the publisher states
it). Attribution to the original publishers is kept in the records.
Compilation, stable keys and cross-matching are by Nesra Vomigarbi
for Examen Civique Test (https://examen-civique-test.fr/).
